            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Kagan, justice Kagan questioned whether the pursuit of a fleeing misdemeanor suspect always qualifies as an exigent circumstance."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Gorsuch",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "5b03da1a84ab108d1c96f5f4dc4c7ab6f0203447eca52e5cfd3874c8b4719fd4",
            "evidence_ids": [
