            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 26,
              "start": 26
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Gorsuch asked whether a categorical rule for felonies would create an absurd incentive for states to elevate ordinary police\u2011lights violations to felonies."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kavanaugh",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "5b03da1a84ab108d1c96f5f4dc4c7ab6f0203447eca52e5cfd3874c8b4719fd4",
