          "text": "According to Amanda K. Rice, amicus counsel (Amanda K. Rice) defines the hot\u2011pursuit exception as a narrow rule that justifies warrantless home entry only when a suspect tries to thwart a lawful public arrest by outrunning an officer, and it does not depend on the classification of the underlying offense."
